Addition
- [N1] Within matched traces (1->1) added: action(n3,"is application rejected")
- [N2] Within matched traces (1->1) added: branch(b1,XOR)

Mutation
- [N3] Node-level mutation: element=guard(b1,n4,"v1 = 'Yes'") -> guard(b1,n5,"v1 = 'No'"); source=i2:If the application is rejected; reason=The guards substitute the explicit source condition with a generic variable assignment ('v1 = Yes/No'), dropping the specific business logic regarding application rejection status.
